+This inventory checks that reviewed ownership and cutpoint vocabulary remains
+present and ordered. It deliberately does not claim to prove kernel descriptor
+identity, OpenSSL behavior, race freedom, timeout enforcement, durable SQLite
+semantics, or peer authentication. Compiled adversarial tests and independent
+compiler/sanitizer lanes carry those semantic obligations.
